Description: Processing three-dimensional animal tracking data, computing
    three-dimensional movement variables (step lengths, turning angles),
    extracting three-dimensional spatial covariates, etc. 
    The methods are described by Klappstein et al. (2025) 
    <doi:10.1101/2025.11.07.687274>.
